erate computation.'], 'type': ['method', 'generic', 'GENERIC'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7]}, 'Holistic optimization': {'description': ['The simultaneous application of sparse methods to both fully connected and convolution layers.', 'The simultaneous optimization of speed and size in sparse CNNs, considering both convolution and fully connected layers.'], 'type': ['task', 'GENERIC'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 4]}, 'Images per second': {'description': ['A performance metric used to evaluate the speed of CNNs, indicating the number of images processed per second.', 'A performance metric indicating the classification throughput of the AlexNet model, with values of 2371 and 120 images per second on respective platforms.', 'A performance metric used to quantify the classification throughput of the AlexNet model, with reported values of 2371 and 120 images per second on respective platforms.', 'A performance metric used to quantify the classification speed of CNNs, representing the number of images processed per second.', 'A performance metric used to quantify the classification speed of the Holistic SparseCNN, representing the number of images processed per second.'], 'type': ['task', 'method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 6, 7]}, 'FC Decay Multiplier 1': {'description': ['A multiplier applied to the weight decay parameter for fully connected layers.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}}
